{"3768490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Quantum Threshold", "steam_appid": 3768490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quantum Threshold</strong> Single-player VR shooter with roguelike elements featuring wheelchair locomotion. Players step into the role of a wheelchair-bound survivor in a post-apocalyptic world infested with AI Techno Wraiths and robots gone rogue, providing a unique and immersive gameplay experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT GAMEPLAY IN VR:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vaki Games's return to the VR games that started it all was built from the ground up for virtual reality. VR was built to enable the gameplay that sits in Wheelchair and seated experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in deep environmental interactions, shooting, world exploration, and visceral combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Wheelchair Warfare, Redefined</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/27f50e36a928b1941507e81f6f51733a.poster.avif?t=1757574550\" width=328 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/27f50e36a928b1941507e81f6f51733a.webm?t=1757574550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/27f50e36a928b1941507e81f6f51733a.mp4?t=1757574550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a weaponized wheelchair engineered for seated VR chaos. Drift through gunfire, deploy turrets mid-roll, and turn limitations into lethality. No standing, no motion sickness—just pure, unapologetic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌀 Die, Adapt, Dominate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/39102bf1a98932c03d792047cd796112.poster.avif?t=1757574550\" width=330 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/39102bf1a98932c03d792047cd796112.webm?t=1757574550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/39102bf1a98932c03d792047cd796112.mp4?t=1757574550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike meets rogue AI: Every run reshapes the battlefield. Unlock permanent upgrades in your hub-world stronghold and craft unstoppable builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Cyberpunk Power Trip</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/98379420bed687c456650c1bb10f659d.poster.avif?t=1757574550\" width=330 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/98379420bed687c456650c1bb10f659d.webm?t=1757574550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/98379420bed687c456650c1bb10f659d.mp4?t=1757574550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new way to play on your own terms, that combines rogue-like elements and deep strategic planning with a persistent and infinitely replayable gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quantum Threshold</strong> Single-player VR shooter with roguelike elements featuring wheelchair locomotion. Players step into the role of a wheelchair-bound survivor in a post-apocalyptic world infested with AI Techno Wraiths and robots gone rogue, providing a unique and immersive gameplay experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT GAMEPLAY IN VR:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vaki Games's return to the VR games that started it all was built from the ground up for virtual reality. VR was built to enable the gameplay that sits in Wheelchair and seated experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in deep environmental interactions, shooting, world exploration, and visceral combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Wheelchair Warfare, Redefined</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/27f50e36a928b1941507e81f6f51733a.poster.avif?t=1757574550\" width=328 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/27f50e36a928b1941507e81f6f51733a.webm?t=1757574550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/27f50e36a928b1941507e81f6f51733a.mp4?t=1757574550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a weaponized wheelchair engineered for seated VR chaos. Drift through gunfire, deploy turrets mid-roll, and turn limitations into lethality. No standing, no motion sickness—just pure, unapologetic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌀 Die, Adapt, Dominate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/39102bf1a98932c03d792047cd796112.poster.avif?t=1757574550\" width=330 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/39102bf1a98932c03d792047cd796112.webm?t=1757574550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/39102bf1a98932c03d792047cd796112.mp4?t=1757574550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike meets rogue AI: Every run reshapes the battlefield. Unlock permanent upgrades in your hub-world stronghold and craft unstoppable builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Cyberpunk Power Trip</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/98379420bed687c456650c1bb10f659d.poster.avif?t=1757574550\" width=330 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/98379420bed687c456650c1bb10f659d.webm?t=1757574550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/extras/98379420bed687c456650c1bb10f659d.mp4?t=1757574550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new way to play on your own terms, that combines rogue-like elements and deep strategic planning with a persistent and infinitely replayable gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Become the Revolution – From a Cyberpunk Wheelchair. In a dystopian cyberpunk hellscape ruled by rogue AI &quot;Techno Wraiths,&quot; you’re no underdog—you’re a wheelchair-bound war machine rewriting the rules of survival. Quantum Threshold thrusts you into relentless, ever-shifting arenas", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Final rating: an original roguelike that is unlike anything else”<br>73 – GeneraciónXR<br><br>“Quantum Threshold might just redefine how you see seated shooters and is a title VR fans should definitely check out.”<br>7,5 – Press Play Media<br><br>“Quantum Threshold wants to be something new — a genre-bending VR roguelite with a unique perspective and inclusive mechanics”<br>Duuro Plays<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/9ab39bb444bc5359133c100ed9d1769372eff357/header.jpg?t=1757574550", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/8aa23aaffb8666502d3835f05a1af68553d80737/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757574550", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768490/8aa23aaffb8666502d3835f05a1af68553d80737/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757574550", "website": "https://quantum-threshold.xsolla.site", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 2600x<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050ti<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Quest, and other VR</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 2600x<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Quest, and other VR</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "@Vaki Games 2025 All rights reserved", "developers": ["Vaki Games"], "publishers": ["Vaki Games"], "p